OL,3,GNEWSANew football pitches could
OL,4,Apreserve mining history
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust five years after Allerton Bywater
OL,7,FMiners FC was set up the club says it
OL,8,Fis now turning away new members due to
OL,9,Fa lack of space.
OL,11,FHaving grown from 12 players to more
OL,12,Fthan 160, the Castleford side now has
OL,13,Fteams ranging from under-fives to the
OL,14,Fsenior men.
OL,16,FBut the rise in members has lead to a
OL,17,Fscarcity of space, with its current
OL,18,Fjunior players left to train and play
OL,19,Fmatches on the outfield of a cricket
OL,20,Fpitch at the Allerton Bywater Sports
OL,21,FGround.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
