OL,3,GNEWSANew football pitches could
OL,4,Apreserve mining history
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the club is looking to build five
OL,7,Fnew junior-sized pitches in a move it
OL,8,Fhopes will not only secure the club's
OL,9,Ffuture and preserve the area's mining
OL,10,Fheritage, but create more opportunities
OL,11,Ffor young people as well.
